    {
      "id": "p0114-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Sans has a skeleton brother named Papyrus, whose name is also a reference to a cheesy, overused computer font. Papyrus' English text is unique in two ways: his dialogue uses the Papyrus computer font, and he only uses capital letters. This combination lends his dialogue a humorous \"oddball\" quality that no other characters in the game share.",
        "raw": "Sans has a skeleton brother named Papyrus, whose name is also a reference to\na cheesy, overused computer font. Papyrus' English text is unique in two ways:\nhis dialogue uses the Papyrus computer font, and he only uses capital letters.\nThis combination lends his dialogue a humorous \"oddball\" quality that no\nother characters in the game share.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.2937405,
          0.26760714,
          0.89925016,
          0.35235
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2871837,
          0.26689286,
          0.90713259,
          0.35342143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          12,
          13,
          15,
          18,
          19
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Sans 有个名叫 Papyrus 的骷髅兄弟，名字同样来自一种俗气、被用滥的电脑字体。Papyrus 的英文台词有两个特点：使用 Papyrus 字体，而且全是大写字母。这种组合给他的台词带来滑稽的“怪人”气质，游戏中其他角色都没有。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29386287,
          0.26617857,
          0.90509315,
          0.35592143
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify",
        "auto_height": true,
        "limit_bottom": 0.5007142857142857,
        "snap_to_guides": true,
        "resize_anchor": "left"
      },
      "calibration": {
