    {
      "id": "p0114-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This solution wasn't perfect, though - in one scene, for example, Papyrus states the name of the main character's current equipment. Because most Japanese equipment names are longer than five characters, the equipment name would extend outside Papyrus' text window. The programmers fixed this rare issue by adding a new \"Papyrus Equipment Name\" list with pre-formatted equipment names.",
        "raw": "This solution wasn't perfect, though - in one scene, for example, Papyrus states the\nname of the main character's current equipment. Because most Japanese equipment\nnames are longer than five characters, the equipment name would extend outside\nPapyrus' text window. The programmers fixed this rare issue by adding a new\n\"Papyrus Equipment Name\" list with pre-formatted equipment names.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28922314,
          0.7617,
          0.90488921,
          0.84779286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2871837,
          0.76098571,
          0.90713259,
          0.84886429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          46,
          47,
          48,
          49,
          50
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "但这个办法并不完美。例如某个场景中，Papyrus 会说出主角当前装备的名字。大多数日文装备名超过五个字，就会伸出他的对话框。程序员于是新增了一张“Papyrus 装备名称”表，存放预先排好格式的装备名，解决这个少见的问题。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
